  "what_this_is": "gerbers, drill, a position file and an assembly/DNP drawing for a fault-response validation board: two UCC24624, two BSC010N04LS6, and the fault interface.  The escapes are rated in current_rating.",
  "what_this_is_not": [
    "an approval to build: hardware_built and fabrication_approved are false",
    "a 100 A power stage -- the board is for one fault event of a few tens of microseconds, and the continuous figure in current_rating is a chart. The 10 A in the board document is a pulse, not a continuous rating",
    "a thermal model: current_rating has no cooling term and no junction temperature, and IPC-2221 has no via-barrel term at all",
    "a checked drawing: assembly.svg is generated from the same placement table as the copper, so the two cannot disagree -- but it has not been compared with a physical first article"
  ],
